# Frontend Rules (React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind)

## 🏗️ Structure
- Components → `apps/web/src/components/{domain}/`
- Pages → `apps/web/src/pages/{role}/` (auth, public, student, instructor, admin, error)
- API client → `apps/web/src/services/api/{resource}.api.ts`
- Hooks → `apps/web/src/hooks/`
- Types → `apps/web/src/types/`

## 📐 Naming
- Component: PascalCase (`LoginForm.tsx`)
- Hook: camelCase + `use` prefix (`useAuth.ts`)
- Constant: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE (`MAX_FILE_SIZE`)
- Boolean: `is/has/should/can` prefix (`isLoading`)
- File: PascalCase.tsx (component), camelCase.ts (utility)

## ✅ MUST
- Use functional components + hooks (NO class components)
- TypeScript strict mode (NO `any`, dùng `unknown` + type guards)
- Use i18n cho mọi text (`t('key')`)
- Use Tailwind (NO inline styles cho complex UI)
- Use React Query cho server state
- Use Zustand cho global state
- Lazy load routes + heavy components
- Add aria-label, role cho a11y
- Props interface rõ ràng

## ❌ NEVER
- Class components
- `any` type
- `console.log` (dùng logger)
- Direct DOM manipulation
- Hardcoded URLs, secrets, text (i18n)
- Magic numbers
- File `.js` (chỉ `.ts` / `.tsx`)
- Comment lặp lại code

## 🧪 Test
- Vitest + React Testing Library
- Coverage ≥ 70% cho UI
- Test behavior, không test implementation
- Use `data-testid` cho test selectors

## 📦 Import Order
1. External (react, libs)
2. Internal (@ioes/*)
3. Absolute (@/...)
4. Relative
5. Styles

